<com:TContent ID="body">

<h1>TModuleView Samples</h1>

<table class="sampletable">

<tr><td class="samplenote">
The <tt>globalization</tt> module is present in this application, so the child controls
render.
</td><td class="sampleaction">
<com:TModuleView ModuleId="globalization">
  The <tt>globalization</tt> module is available, so this content renders.
</com:TModuleView>
</td></tr>

<tr><td class="samplenote">
The <tt>payments</tt> module is not present, so the fallback template renders instead of
the child controls.
</td><td class="sampleaction">
<com:TModuleView ModuleId="payments">
  <com:THyperLink Text="Manage payments" NavigateUrl="#" />
  <prop:FallbackTemplate>
    Payments are not enabled.
  </prop:FallbackTemplate>
</com:TModuleView>
</td></tr>

<tr><td class="samplenote">
The <tt>globalization</tt> module is present, but the condition is false, so the fallback
template renders.
</td><td class="sampleaction">
<com:TModuleView ModuleId="globalization" Condition="1 > 2">
  This content is hidden because the condition is false.
  <prop:FallbackTemplate>
    The condition is false.
  </prop:FallbackTemplate>
</com:TModuleView>
</td></tr>

</table>

</com:TContent>
